						<div class="panel-body"><strong>Ans.</strong><p>The lead generation process creates brand visibility, builds credibility and trust, and generates interest from a specific group of people. It is important to create interest in your product or service and generate high-quality customers for the company.
</p>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
				
				<div class="panel panel-default">
					<div class="panel-heading">
						<h4 class="panel-title">
							<a data-toggle="collapse" data-parent="#accordion" href="#collapse3">Q.3.  How is Lead Generation different from Demand Generation?
</a>
						</h4>
					</div>
					<div id="collapse3" class="panel-collapse collapse">
						<div class="panel-body"><strong>Ans.</strong>
							<p>When a business launches a new product or service, people do not know about the brand or that new product. Demand generation is the process of generating awareness of a new product or service. It gives people a reason to learn and get excited about the new product or service and marketers convert them into leads. It means that demand generation can feed your lead generation effort. As demand generation effort is producing a lot of traffic, lead generation service validates the right kind of traffic.	</p>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
				
				<div class="panel panel-default">
					<div class="panel-heading">
						<h4 class="panel-title">
							<a data-toggle="collapse" data-parent="#accordion" href="#collapse4">Q.4. How does lead generation work online?
</a>
						</h4>
					</div>
					<div id="collapse4" class="panel-collapse collapse">
						<div class="panel-body"><strong>Ans.</strong><p>Lead generation companies help in building interest in your product or service. They come up with precise targeting campaigns. They collect leads by building a website and optimizing and maintaining that website to attract visitors and obtain their information usually through a contact form. They also gather records from digital and trade publications, trade references, and public records and identify the right leads from the database and analytics. 
</p>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
				
				<div class="panel panel-default">
