							<a data-toggle="collapse" data-parent="#accordion" href="#collapse5">Q.5. Which industries can benefit from lead generation?

</a>
						</h4>
					</div>
					<div id="collapse5" class="panel-collapse collapse">
						<div class="panel-body"><strong>Ans.</strong><p>Lead generation service is required by every company or industry that is in need of customers. So, all those industries that need a strong customer base can be benefited from lead generation service.

</p>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
				
				<div class="panel panel-default">
