							<a data-toggle="collapse" data-parent="#accordion" href="#collapse6">Q.6. What is the cost per lead campaign?


</a>
						</h4>
					</div>
					<div id="collapse6" class="panel-collapse collapse">
						<div class="panel-body"><strong>Ans.</strong><p>Cost per Lead or CPL is the digital marketing pricing model in which the advertiser pays a pre-established price for each lead generated. When any prospective customer sees an ad, clicks on it, and gives his/her contact details in exchange for more information about your product, a specific amount is paid by the advertiser.  
</p>
